# What the deployment does not need.
#
# The deployed artefact is packages/web/dist plus the serverless API in api/,
# which imports packages/engine and packages/api. Everything below is in the
# repository for other reasons and only slows the upload — and, because Vercel
# offers every directory containing a package.json when it asks you to pick a
# Root Directory, having them present makes that question harder to answer than
# it should be. The answer is always the repository root.

# A separate React app, not part of this deployment and not a workspace.
packages/frontend

# A separate Express/Postgres service, not part of this deployment.
packages/backend

# Python. Cannot run on this Node deployment at all.
packages/optimizer

# Screenshots for the README — about 2.3 MB, and nothing serves them.
docs/images

# A reference file kept for its markup, never imported.
template

node_modules
packages/*/node_modules
packages/*/dist
